    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> May 8, 2026<br><strong>Last Updated:</strong> May 8, 2026</p><p>Welcome to Aviantestpro. These Terms and Conditions (“Terms”) govern your access to and use of the Aviantestpro website, products, laboratory-related services, reports, customer support, online ordering systems, and all associated content and services (collectively, the “Services”).</p><p>By accessing or using this website and related Services, you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree to these Terms, you should discontinue use of the Services immediately.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>1. Company Information</h2><p>Aviantestpro provides avian DNA testing services, bird genetic identification services, non-human laboratory analysis support, scientific information, laboratory-related products, and associated customer support services for international customers.</p><p>For questions regarding these Terms, contact:</p><p><strong>Email:</strong> <a><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="d3b2b7bebabd93b2a5bab2bda7b6a0a7a3a1bcfdb0bcbe">[email&#160;protected]</span></a><br><strong>Website:</strong> <a>https://aviantestpro.com</a></p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>2. Eligibility and Use of Services</h2><p>By using this website, you represent that:</p><ul><li>You are legally capable of entering into binding agreements</li><li>You will comply with applicable laws and regulations</li><li>You will not misuse the website or Services</li><li>You will provide accurate information where requested</li><li>You are authorized to submit any biological samples provided to Aviantestpro</li></ul><p>Users may not use the Services for unlawful, prohibited, fraudulent, misleadi