/h2><p>Users agree to comply with all applicable:</p><ul><li>Local laws</li><li>National regulations</li><li>Wildlife regulations</li><li>Import/export laws</li><li>Biosecurity requirements</li><li>Shipping regulations</li><li>Animal-related regulations</li></ul><p>Users are solely responsible for determining whether the Services are lawful in their jurisdiction.</p><p>Aviantestpro does not guarantee that all Services are legally available in every country or region.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>9. Website Content and Information Accuracy</h2><p>Aviantestpro makes commercially reasonable efforts to provide accurate information.</p><p>However, we do not guarantee that website content is:</p><ul><li>Complete</li><li>Continuously updated</li><li>Error-free</li><li>Universally applicable</li><li>Scientifically exhaustive</li></ul><p>Scientific methodologies, regulations, and industry standards may evolve over time.</p><p>Website content may be modified, updated, suspended, or removed without notice.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>10. Intellectual Property Rights</h2><p>All website content, including but not limited to:</p><ul><li>Text</li><li>Graphics</li><li>Logos</li><li>Laboratory descriptions</li><li>Reports</li><li>Technical content</li><li>Images</li><li>Website design</li><li>Documentation</li></ul><p>is protected by applicable intellectual property laws unless otherwise stated.</p><p>Users may not:</p><ul><li>Copy</li><li>Redistribute</li><li>Commercially exploit</li><li>Republish</li><li>Modify</li><li>Reverse engineer</li></ul><p>website content without prior written authorization.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>11. Prohibited Activities</h2><p>Users may not:</p><ul><li>Use the website for unlawful purposes</li><li>Attempt unauthorized access to systems</li><li>Interfere with website functionality</li><li>Submit fraudulent information</li><li>Upload maliciou