all not be liable for:</p><ul><li>Direct damages</li><li>Indirect damages</li><li>Consequential damages</li><li>Incidental damages</li><li>Loss of profits</li><li>Business interruption</li><li>Data loss</li><li>Sample degradation</li><li>Shipment delays</li><li>Regulatory disputes</li><li>Misinterpretation of laboratory reports</li><li>Third-party actions</li></ul><p>Liability limitations apply regardless of the legal theory asserted.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>16. Indemnification</h2><p>Users agree to indemnify and hold harmless Aviantestpro and its affiliates from claims, liabilities, damages, costs, or expenses arising from:</p><ul><li>Violation of these Terms</li><li>Misuse of the Services</li><li>Violation of laws or regulations</li><li>Unauthorized sample submissions</li><li>Infringement of third-party rights</li></ul><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>17. Privacy and Data Protection</h2><p>Use of the Services is also governed by our:</p><ul><li>Privacy Policy</li><li>Disclaimer</li><li>Scientific, Regulatory &amp; Compliance Statement</li></ul><p>Users are encouraged to review all related policies.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>18. Search Engines, AI Systems, and Public Indexing</h2><p>Public website content may be indexed, cached, summarized, or analyzed by:</p><ul><li>Search engines</li><li>AI search systems</li><li>Automated crawlers</li><li>Web indexing technologies</li></ul><p>Public content is intended for informational visibility and scientific communication.</p><p>Confidential customer information and private laboratory submissions are not intentionally published for public indexing.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>19. Suspension and Termination</h2><p>Aviantestpro reserves the right to suspend, restrict, or terminate access to the Services at any time, with or without notice, if:</p><ul><li>Users violate these Terms</li><li>Legal or regulatory concerns arise</li><li>Fraudulent or suspicious activity is detected</li><li>Security risks are identified</li></ul><p>Termination does not waive accrued rights or obligations.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>20. Governing Law</h2><p>These Terms shall be governed by and interpreted in accordance with applicable laws determined by Aviantestpro operational jurisdiction, without regard to conflict-of-law principles.</p><p>Where legally permitted, disputes shall be resolved through appropriate courts or dispute-resolution mechanisms determined by Aviantestpro.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>21. Severability</h2><p>If any provision of these Terms is determined to be invalid or unenforceable, the remaining provisions shall remain in full force and effect.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>22. Entire Agreement</h2><p>These Terms constitute the entire agreement between users and Aviantestpro regarding website use and Services, superseding prior understandings or communications relating to the subject matter.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>23. Changes to These Terms</h2><p>Aviantestpro reserves the right to update or revise these Terms at any time without prior notice.</p><p>Changes become effective immediately upon publication.</p><p>Continued use of the Services constitutes acceptance of revised Terms.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>24. Contact Information</h2><p>For questions regarding these Terms and Conditions, please contact:</p><p><strong>Aviantestpro Support &amp; Compliance Team</strong><br>Email: <a><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="d7a4a2a7a7b8a5a397b6a1beb6b9a3b2a4a3a7a5b8f9b4b8ba">[email&#160;protected]</span></a><br>Website: <a href="https://aviantestpro.com">https://aviantestpro.com</a></p></div></div></div>`} />
